Lemma 10: f(f(f(f(X, f(f(Y, Z), f(X, Y))), f(f(Z, X), X)), Y), X) = f(Z, X).
Proof:
  f(f(f(f(X, f(f(Y, Z), f(X, Y))), f(f(Z, X), X)), Y), X)
= { by lemma 2 R->L }
