Lemma 11: f(f(f(X, f(f(Y, Z), f(X, Y))), f(f(Z, X), X)), Y) = Z.
Proof:
  f(f(f(X, f(f(Y, Z), f(X, Y))), f(f(Z, X), X)), Y)
= { by lemma 7 R->L }
